            <ArticleTitle>Cardiac complications during use of etomidate.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1183-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two patients are described who exhibited cardiac complications during administration of etomidate. One patient showed myocardial ischaemia and the other developed cardiac asystole.</AbstractText>
